01:19:19.390 --> 01:19:25.170
The only trouble with Santa Isabel, it's in the opposite direction to where you want to go.

01:19:25.880 --> 01:19:27.260
That's what I figured.

01:19:28.330 --> 01:19:29.490
Your other choice is...

01:19:30.990 --> 01:19:33.600
When you get to the road, you look to the right,

01:19:35.410 --> 01:19:37.030
you'll see the Lagos de Zapitans.

01:19:38.440 --> 01:19:40.440
They have an airplane charter service there.

01:19:42.660 --> 01:19:46.600
In two hours, you could be on your way to Mexico City.

01:19:47.470 --> 01:19:50.930
I like that better. Why don't you tell her to come along with me?

01:19:51.110 --> 01:19:54.260
She needs a doctor. No reason for you both to die here,

01:19:55.610 --> 01:19:56.990
unless you want it that way.

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:01.520
