01:20:09.360 --> 01:20:10.340
I'm staying right here.

01:20:12.260 --> 01:20:14.120
You'd rather have him dead than me alive?

01:20:15.650 --> 01:20:17.170
That's exactly what I mean.

01:20:40.360 --> 01:20:49.320
I could have killed him while I had the rifle.

01:20:53.010 --> 01:20:57.600
Get a stick or something. Scoop the dirt from under the rock.

01:21:02.230 --> 01:21:08.350
I'm gonna track him down, I'm gonna track him down and kill him.

01:21:10.250 --> 01:21:11.730
Can't let a guy like that go on living.

01:21:18.000 --> 01:21:22.440
You'll come to a little Indian village called Santa Isabel.

01:21:23.520 --> 01:21:25.720
Go there, you give him ten dollars. They'll come and get us.

01:21:26.430 --> 01:21:29.970
Your other choice is, you look to the right, you'll see the lagos.

01:21:30.940 --> 01:21:36.460
got an airplane charter service there in two hours you could be on your way to mexico city

