Dan, I've got to stop.

01:22:19.400 --> 01:22:20.360
I can't go any further.

01:22:20.960 --> 01:22:22.880
Oh, come on, just a little farther, huh?

01:22:23.710 --> 01:22:26.270
Come on, just a little ways more, huh?

01:22:27.960 --> 01:22:29.940
We'll bed down for the night in that canyon.

01:22:30.510 --> 01:22:32.730
Come on, that's it.

